    <tags>sweepr cleaner disk-cleanup storage uninstaller ccleaner-alternative windows-11 rust</tags>
    <summary>Native Rust PC &amp; SSD cleaner for Windows 10/11: unlimited free temp/browser cache clean and 7-Day Undo Quarantine (5 GB default).</summary>
    <description>SWEEPR Cleaner is a fast, lightweight native Rust PC cleaner and storage optimizer for Windows 10 and Windows 11. SWEEPR Free: Unlimited Temp &amp; Browser Cache Clean (to OS Recycle Bin); Pro unlocks Deep GPU/AI/Dev Caches, SHA-256 Duplicates, Uninstaller, Scheduler &amp; 7-Day Undo Quarantine (configurable 2–10 GB disk budget, 5 GB default, same-volume O(1) move; OS Recycle Bin fallback if file exceeds budget; excludes shredded files, browser DBs, and registry edits). Includes Zero-Telemetry Offline Mode toggle.</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://sweeprcleaner.com/state-of-windows-storage</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
